message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below (preferred). This software has its own metadata at the top level."
title: "iiot-qelm: companion implementation of Attention-QELM-GWO for rare-attack detection in IIoT networks"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/parthachk64-cyber/attention-qelm-gwo-reproduction"
abstract: >-
  Independently written Python implementation of the Attention-guided quantum-inspired extreme learning machine
  with grey wolf optimization, with data validation, ten baselines, seven ablations, fold-safe GWO tuning, a
  recomputable evaluation pipeline and a data-independent audit of the published article. Not the authors' code.
